# Open-source PR hygiene

This repo is public on GitHub. Keep all agent-generated git and review surfaces free of internal Box references and media.

## Never include JIRA tickets in

- Branch names (e.g. do not use `PREVIEW-1234-...`)
- PR titles
- PR descriptions
- Commit messages
- Code comments

Use a conventional subject only, e.g. `feat(gallery): add ARIA grid for 2D navigation`.

## Never mention internal repos or systems

Do not name private Box repos, internal services, Conduit/JIRA URLs, or other non-public tooling in commits, PRs, comments, or docs that ship with the open-source tree.

## Never attach screenshots or videos to PRs

Do not embed or link recordings/screenshots in the PR description. Share media privately (e.g. Box) outside the public PR.

## Examples

```text
# ❌ BAD
fix(doc): release pdf page memory (PREVIEW-1246)
Branch: PREVIEW-1548-release-pdf-page-memory
PR body: See WEBAPP-1234 and preview-client recordings: <box link>

# ✅ GOOD
fix(doc): release pdf page memory
Branch: fix/release-pdf-page-memory
PR body: Summary + test plan only; no ticket keys, internal repos, or media
```
